    "note": "Version read: Amended 2018-05-25 (Assembly vote 2018-05-31 on it; no other floor vote listed). Large bill; quoted only core parts. Also adds Article 8-9 (vendor licensing, Section 30485) and amends Section 29805 to add Section 30405 to the misdemeanor list. Marked changes in this version are only 'firearms' -> 'firearm' wording edits in 30406 and 30447."
